This is 99% invisible. I'm Roman Mars. In the late 1960s, an Italian industrialist and a Scottish scientist started a club to address what they considered to be humankind's greatest problems, things like pollution, resource scarcity, and overpopulation. And because this group met in Rome, Italy, it came to be known as the Club of Rome. Producer Katie Mingle. Over the next couple of years, the Club of Rome would grow to include politicians, scientists, economists, and business leaders from around the world.
这里是“99%无形”（99% Invisible）。我是罗曼·马尔斯（Roman Mars）。在20世纪60年代末，一位意大利实业家和一位苏格兰科学家发起了一个俱乐部，旨在解决他们认为的全人类最严重的问题，比如污染、资源匮乏和人口过剩。由于这个小组成员在意大利罗马开会，它后来被称为“罗马俱乐部”（Club of Rome）。本集节目由制片人凯蒂·明格尔（Katie Mingle）制作。在接下来的几年里，罗马俱乐部不断发展壮大，吸引了来自世界各地的政治家、科学家、经济学家和商界领袖。

